          "html": "<div class=\"em-dashboard\">\n  <header class=\"em-header\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"em-kicker\">LIVE</div>\n      <h1>Energiemanagement</h1>\n      <p>Haus · Halle · Wohnung</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"em-soc\">\n      <span>SmartShunt</span>\n      <strong>{alias.0.Gobel.Soc SmartShunt}%</strong>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"em-net\">\n    <h2>Netz</h2>\n    <div class=\"em-grid em-grid-3\">\n      <article class=\"em-card\">\n        <span>Haus</span>\n        <strong>{alias.0.EM24 New Grid.Power}</strong>\n        <small>W · + Bezug / − Einspeisung</small>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"em-card\">\n        <span>Halle</span>\n        <strong>{alias.0.EM24 Hall Grid.Power}</strong>\n        <small>W · Grenze −27 / +15 kW</small>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"em-card\">\n        <span>Wohnung</span>\n        <strong>{alias.0.EM24 Old Grid.Power Old Grid}</strong>\n        <small>W · Zählpunkt 3</small>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"em-pv\">\n    <h2>PV aktuell</h2>\n    <div class=\"em-grid em-grid-2\">\n      <article class=\"em-card em-accent-green\"><span>Fronius Halle · 27 kW</span><strong>{alias.0.Fronius.AC-Power}</strong><small>W</small></article>\n      <article class=\"em-card em-accent-yellow\"><span>Fronius Haus · 10 kW</span><strong>{alias.0.Fronius.AC-Power_10kW}</strong><small>W</small></article>\n      <article class=\"em-card em-accent-blue\"><span>SMA Haus · 4,7 kW</span><strong>{alias.0.SMA.Power}</strong><small>W</small></article>\n      <article class=\"em-card em-accent-red\"><span>SolarEdge Wohnung · 17 kW</span><strong>{alias.0.SE.Power}</strong><small>W</small></article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"em-battery-section\">\n    <h2>Batterie</h2>\n    <a class=\"em-detail-link\" href=\"#Batterie\" aria-label=\"Batteriedetails öffnen\">\n      <div class=\"em-battery\">\n        <div><span>Leistung</span><strong>{0_userdata.0.EOS.Battery.Summary.Power} W</strong></div>\n        <div><span>Spannung</span><strong>{0_userdata.0.EOS.Battery.Summary.Voltage} V</strong></div>\n        <div><span>Strom</span><strong>{0_userdata.0.EOS.Battery.Summary.Current} A</strong></div>\n        <div><span>SOC</span><strong>{0_userdata.0.EOS.Battery.Summary.SOC}%</strong></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"em-detail-label\"><span>Status: {0_userdata.0.EOS.Battery.Summary.Status}</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">›</b></div>\n    </a>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"em-pool-summary\">\n    <h2>Pool</h2>\n    <a class=\"em-detail-link em-pool-tile\" href=\"#Pool\" aria-label=\"Poolsteuerung öffnen\">\n      <div class=\"em-pool-main-temp\"><span>Pooltemperatur · Rücklauf</span><strong>{javascript.0.Pool.RL} °C</strong><small>Vorlauf {javascript.0.Pool.VL} °C</small></div>\n      <div class=\"em-pool-main-io\">\n        <span class=\"em-dot\" data-state=\"{s7.0.Inputs.0.I1}\">H2O</span>\n        <span class=\"em-dot\" data-state=\"{s7.0.Outputs.0.Q1}\">Pumpe</span>\n        <span class=\"em-dot\" data-state=\"{s7.0.Outputs.0.Q2}\">Salz/pH</span>\n        <span class=\"em-dot\" data-state=\"{s7.0.Outputs.0.Q3}\">Füllen</span>\n        <span class=\"em-dot\" data-state=\"{s7.0.Outputs.0.Q4}\">Wärmepumpe</span>\n      </div>\n      <b class=\"em-tile-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</b>\n    </a>\n  </section>\n</div>\n",
